It isn't. CC is simply a convenient form of shop robbing where instead
of having your pet steal items from the shop, the pet steals money
which you can then reuse. Even if the DevTeam removes the practice from
the next version, one can still effectively clean out a shop the old
fashioned way: have the pet steal the most expensive items in the shop
and continually sell them back to the shopkeeper.

It doesn't break game balance, because it only thing it breaks is the
amount of time required to clean out a shop.

